  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maintaining Low HIV Prevalence in the Republic of Serbia - Serbia (01-Jan-2026-31-Dec-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia, HIV, Institute of Public Health of Serbia &quot;Dr Milan Jovanovic Batut&quot; (IPHS)This program has the following goals: Strenghtening sustainability and transition of HIV prevention in Serbia. The objectives of this program are: Sustainability of community based HIV preventive services and introduction of innovative approaches.  Stenghtening laboratory system for HIV.  Strenghtening sustainable M&amp;E system</narrative>
  </description>
